        <mxCell id="source-scope-note" value="PARTIAL_SCOPE_OR_ACCEPTANCE. The two readers are different services. No general Guest public profile endpoint or arbitrary target access through the sitter own-profile route is invented. Read source/port lifeline groups the named query dependencies; it is not an invented runtime repository class. A read-only snapshot transaction, when used in source, does not imply a domain mutation, replay result store, ledger entry or money transfer. Sources: backend/src/services/dashboards/sitter-list.service.js; backend/src/services/dashboards/mongo-sitter-profile.repository.js; backend/src/services/sitter-management.service.js; backend/src/routes/sitter-management.routes.js." style="shape=note;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
